rue},{"uid":"zhcn:8069b0d78f737248d2f1d95f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"走吧……！","source_fingerprint":"2a238b480d3d3b03a89f94c8a262afa5391cdeb5e27e2403a45c68ff1ba0db50","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1047","1000"],"entry_index":10,"target_text":"Đi thôi……!","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:e86cb2c8ad9d90aac02e60db","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"没想到训练员正在寻觅的英雄\r\n就是我……这个命中注定的插曲\r\n真是令人难以忘怀呢。","source_fingerprint":"421e257631f4d4d16e48dba3bf45d63ef698ec70a56a06ddf3449d35b9906890","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1047","10000"],"entry_index":11,"target_text":"Không ngờ vị anh hùng Trainer đang tìm kiếm\r\nlại chính là mình…… Khúc ngoặt định mệnh ấy\r\nthật khó mà quên được.","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:50ec3a3f7b3ac6935a57bc66","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"行ってきます。","source_fingerprint":"793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1047","100000"],"entry_index":12,"target_text":"Tôi đi đây.","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:453756af0bbd7a98224f5402","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"ただいま戻りました。","source_fingerprint":"6187171daf0cd83405ed28676a1e5578db71985c3568e13f3c699b7bfbf84546","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1047","100001"],"entry_index":13,"target_text":"Tôi về rồi.","reviewed":true},{"uid":"zhcn:98916ce1496d4729c67c55c8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"只要有人愿意注视我，\r\n荒漠英雄就永远不会停下脚步，\r\n持续向前奔跑……！","source_fingerprint":"84a72eeb8e2b6910335c8714987490f26d54ffe7a2b8fb909df25ae24346c95b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1047","10001"],"entry_index":14,"target_text":"Chỉ cần vẫn có người dõi theo mình,\r\nZenno Rob Roy sẽ không bao giờ dừng bước,\r\nmà sẽ tiếp tục tiến về phía trước……!","reviewed":true}]}